<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Module Download</title></head>
<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px;">
  <div style="background: #4F46E5; color: white; padding: 20px; text-align: center; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0;">
    <h1 style="margin: 0;">Module Ready for Download</h1>
  </div>
  <div style="background: #f9fafb; padding: 30px; border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;">
    <p>Hi {{name}},</p>
    <p>Thank you for your interest! Here are the module details:</p>
    <div style="background: white; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; margin: 20px 0;">
      <h3 style="margin-top:0; color: #4F46E5;">{{moduleName}}</h3>
      <p><strong>Course:</strong> {{courseName}}</p>
      {{#if moduleDescription}}
      <p><strong>Description:</strong> {{moduleDescription}}</p>
      {{/if}}
      <p><strong>Lessons included:</strong></p>
      <ul style="margin: 10px 0; padding-left: 20px;">
        {{#each lessons}}
        <li>{{this.title}} {{#if this.duration}}({{this.duration}} min){{/if}}</li>
        {{/each}}
      </ul>
    </div>
    <p style="color: #6b7280; font-size: 14px;">
      Our team will send you the detailed PDF for this module shortly.
      If you have any questions, feel free to reply to this email.
    </p>
    <div style="text-align: center; margin: 30px 0;">
      <a href="{{clientUrl}}/courses" style="background: #4F46E5; color: white; padding: 12px 24px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px;">Browse More Courses</a>
    </div>
    <p>Best,<br>The KKIT Team</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
